page('/privacy/','Privacy & Browser Storage','How this directory uses browser storage and external links.',heading('PRIVACY','Simple tools. Clear data practices.','Updated October 9, 2026.')+'''<article class="prose narrow"><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>Shortlists and comparison worksheet entries are stored locally in your browser. The site does not transmit those entries to a server. You can clear them using the available controls or your browser settings.</p><h2>Browsing and hosting</h2><p>The hosting provider may process routine request information, such as IP addresses, browser data, and access logs, to serve and protect the website. This release has no advertising trackers, analytics tags, or server-side account system installed.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Firm websites, source directories, AE booking pages, and email links are external services with their own privacy practices. Information you send through email or enter on a booking page is not part of the local shortlist tool.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this publication may be sent to team@aetaxadvisors.com. Do not send sensitive tax documents through a directory correction request.</p></article>''')
page('/terms/','Directory Terms & Information Limitations','Terms for directory research, promotional placement, and buyer education.',heading('TERMS','Use the directory as a research starting point.','Updated October 9, 2026.')+'''<article class="prose narrow"><h2>Information and suitability</h2><p>Listings and buyer guides provide general information. They are not tax, legal, investment, or accounting advice for your facts. No professional engagement is created by browsing, saving a firm, or using the worksheet.</p><h2>Third-party records</h2><p>Public information changes. Confirm credentials, services, fees, location, and availability directly with the provider before relying on them. Directory inclusion does not guarantee service quality, results, or tax savings.</p><h2>Ownership and promotion</h2><p>AE Tax Advisors owns this publication and receives the first featured placement. That placement is not an independent comparative ranking.</p><h2>Names and marks</h2><p>Firm names identify listed organizations. Third-party names and trademarks belong to their respective owners. Inclusion does not imply a partnership or endorsement.</p></article>''')
